            "detailed_description": "Musical Reflex is a game as its name suggests where you can test your musical reflex by having fun or trying to improve yourself and try to be the best in the ladder.<br />\r\nThe principle of the game is pretty simple, press the right keys at the right time all this enbiencer with a music chooses.<br />\r\nIf you found some bug or you have tips for improving the game you are welcome to share them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey features :<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 3 songs <br />\r\n- 4 game modes : classic, speed, ranked (with a ladder) and kill them all (fun game mode).<br />\r\n- 7 backgrounds and 7 differents colors for the balls that you can change by buying them in the shop for money win in-game.",
